---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = "August 2026";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Learn how Pixelquil protects your privacy through local browser processing, zero server uploads, and transparent third party ad data disclosures."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand-600">
      Privacy Policy
    </span>

    <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-10 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Executive Summary</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Pixelquil operates under a local processing architecture. Every utility, converter, and validation tool executes scripts directly inside your web browser. Vector files, markup, source code, and configuration values pasted into our tools are never uploaded, analyzed, or stored on external servers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Information We Do Not Collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We do not require user accounts or personal profiles to access core platform utilities. We do not store, inspect, or log contents processed through client side scripts. Formats, code minifications, and image conversions happen locally in your browser memory space via JavaScript.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Information We Collect and Third Party Vendors</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          <strong class="text-slate-900">Contact Communication Data.</strong> When submitting inquiries through our <a href="/contact/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline font-medium">contact form</a>, your provided name, email address, and message contents are transmitted securely using Formspree. This information is used strictly to reply to user inquiries and is never sold to marketing lists.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          <strong class="text-slate-900">Infrastructure and Network Logs.</strong> Pixelquil is hosted via Cloudflare. Standard access logs, such as IP addresses and browser agent headers, are automatically processed at the network level to protect the site against cyber threats, DDOS attacks, and malicious bot activity.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          <strong class="text-slate-900">Advertising Networks and Cookies.</strong> Display advertisements on Pixelquil are served through Google AdSense. Google uses cookies, web beacons, and persistent identifiers to serve tailored ads based on your visit history across this and other websites on the internet.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Google AdSense and DoubleClick Disclosures</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Third party vendors, including Google, use cookies to display relevant advertising based on prior site navigation. Google use of the DoubleClick cookie enables it and its partners to serve targeted ads based on your visits to our site and other online properties.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          You may opt out of personalized advertising setups by adjusting your preferences at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline font-medium" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>. You can also opt out of third party personalized cookies by visiting <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline font-medium" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">About Ads Choice Page</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Third Party Service Directory</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Pixelquil integrates with specific infrastructure providers to deliver services reliably:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
          <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Cloudflare</strong> for global content delivery, domain routing, and web application firewall protection.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Formspree</strong> for managing and delivering contact message transmissions.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Google AdSense</strong> for serving network display advertisements.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Data Rights and Privacy Regulations</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Under regulations like the General Data Protection Regulation and California Consumer Privacy Act, users hold rights regarding personal data inspection, correction, and deletion. Because Pixelquil operates without database accounts or stored files, personal records are limited to direct email inquiries.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          To request the removal of historical communication records sent via our contact page, submit an explicit deletion request to <a href="mailto:hello@pixelquil.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline font-medium">hello@pixelquil.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Protection of Children</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Pixelquil does not knowingly collect personal information from individuals under thirteen years of age. If a parent or guardian discovers that a child has provided contact details to us, please reach out so we can purge the information immediately.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Policy Revisions</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We update this privacy policy periodically to reflect platform adjustments or legal requirements. Revisions are communicated by updating the date marker at the top of this documentation page.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Contact Information</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Questions regarding this privacy statement can be directed to <a href="mailto:hello@pixelquil.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline font-medium">hello@pixelquil.com</a> or through our <a href="/contact/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline font-medium">contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>